        "value": "<p data-start=\"444\" data-end=\"487\"><strong data-start=\"448\" data-end=\"485\">Test Protocol &amp; Exercise Details:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"488\" data-end=\"925\">\n<li data-start=\"488\" data-end=\"570\">\n<p data-start=\"490\" data-end=\"570\"><strong data-start=\"490\" data-end=\"508\">Protocol Used:</strong> Bruce Protocol (or Modified Bruce / Naughton as applicable)</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"571\" data-end=\"612\">\n<p data-start=\"573\" data-end=\"612\"><strong data-start=\"573\" data-end=\"595\">Exercise Duration:</strong> ______ minutes</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"613\" data-end=\"659\">\n<p data-start=\"615\" data-end=\"659\"><strong data-start=\"615\" data-end=\"645\">Maximum Workload Achieved:</strong> ______ METs</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"660\" data-end=\"707\">\n<p data-start=\"662\" data-end=\"707\"><strong data-start=\"662\" data-end=\"694\">Maximum Heart Rate Achieved:</strong> ______ bpm</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"708\" data-end=\"764\">\n<p data-start=\"710\" data-end=\"764\"><strong data-start=\"710\" data-end=\"753\">% of Age-Predicted Maximum HR Achieved:</strong> ______ %</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"765\" data-end=\"842\">\n<p data-start=\"767\" data-end=\"842\"><strong data-start=\"767\" data-end=\"795\">Blood Pressure Response:</strong> Normal / Hypertensive / Hypotensive response</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"843\" data-end=\"925\">\n<p data-start=\"845\" data-end=\"925\"><strong data-start=\"845\" data-end=\"870\">Symptoms During Test:</strong> None / Chest pain / Dyspnea / Fatigue / Palpitations</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"932\" data-end=\"955\"><strong data-start=\"936\" data-end=\"953\">ECG Findings:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"956\" data-end=\"1267\">\n<li data-start=\"956\" data-end=\"1024\">\n<p data-start=\"958\" data-end=\"1024\"><strong data-start=\"958\" data-end=\"970\">At Rest:</strong> Normal sinus rhythm / Baseline ST-T changes / Other</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1025\" data-end=\"1206\">\n<p data-start=\"1027\" data-end=\"1049\"><strong data-start=\"1027\" data-end=\"1047\">During Exercise:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1052\" data-end=\"1206\">\n<li data-start=\"1052\" data-end=\"1121\">\n<p data-start=\"1054\" data-end=\"1121\">ST segment depression / elevation: None / ______ mm, ______ leads</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1124\" data-end=\"1206\">\n<p data-start=\"1126\" data-end=\"1206\">Arrhythmias: None / PVCs / SVT / Atrial fibrillation / Ventricular tachycardia</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1207\" data-end=\"1267\">\n<p data-start=\"1209\" data-end=\"1267\"><strong data-start=\"1209\" data-end=\"1229\">During Recovery:</strong> ST-T changes normalized / persisted</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1274\" data-end=\"1301\"><strong data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1299\">Test Termination:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1302\" data-end=\"1403\">\n<li data-start=\"1302\" data-end=\"1403\">\n<p data-start=\"1304\" data-end=\"1403\">Reason: Achieved target HR / Fatigue / Dyspnea / Chest pain / Significant ST changes / Arrhythmia</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1410\" data-end=\"1441\"><strong data-start=\"1414\" data-end=\"1439\">Summary &amp; Impression:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1442\" data-end=\"1824\">\n<li data-start=\"1442\" data-end=\"1502\">\n<p data-start=\"1444\" data-end=\"1502\"><strong data-start=\"1444\" data-end=\"1466\">Exercise Capacity:</strong> Good / Average / Poor (____ METs)</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1503\" data-end=\"1564\">\n<p data-start=\"1505\" data-end=\"1564\"><strong data-start=\"1505\" data-end=\"1534\">Heart Rate &amp; BP Response:</strong> Normal / Abnormal (details)</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1565\" data-end=\"1765\">\n<p data-start=\"1567\" data-end=\"1591\"><strong data-start=\"1567\" data-end=\"1589\">Ischemic Response:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1594\" data-end=\"1765\">\n<li data-start=\"1594\" data-end=\"1670\">\n<p data-start=\"1596\" data-end=\"1670\">Negative for inducible ischemia (no significant ST changes, no symptoms)</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1673\" data-end=\"1765\">\n<p data-start=\"1675\" data-end=\"1765\">OR Positive for inducible ischemia (ST depression &ge;1 mm in ______ leads with chest pain)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1766\" data-end=\"1824\">\n<p data-start=\"1768\" data-end=\"1824\"><strong data-start=\"1768\" data-end=\"1783\">Arrhythmia:</strong> None / Noted during exercise (specify)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1831\" data-end=\"1854\"><strong data-start=\"1831\" data-end=\"1852\">Final Impression:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1855\" data-end=\"2081\">\n<li data-start=\"1855\" data-end=\"2081\">\n<p data-start=\"1857\" data-end=\"2081\">TMT <strong data-start=\"1861\" data-end=\"1896\">Negative for inducible ischemia</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
        "field": "textEditor"
      },
